{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織誕生日おめぺろ(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、\n昨日は\nまいちゅん、ひめたん、さゆりんと\n『超能力研究部の3人』観てきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんよりお先に"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/11/27/1454220/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ\n『君の名は希望』のMVが懐かしい(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感想は一言じゃ言えないんだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや\n面倒くさい夏休みの宿題、読書感想文の\n400字詰の原稿用紙5枚とかでも足らない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ\nこの映画のポスターに\n『ぜんぶウソ。っていう、ホント。』\nって書いてあるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なるほどな～って思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはヲタ友で見に行って\n見終わった後ファストフードやらファミレスで\nわいわい語るコースがオヌヌメです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/11/27/1454220/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーでも、\n一人でじっくり見に行くのも面白いかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう先行上映会とかで\n見たかたもいるかもしれないですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだのかたは\n12/6全国ロードショーなので、\nお楽しみに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/11/27/1454220/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、\n『希望的リフレイン』の発売日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type Dです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『風の螺旋』MV見てください！\nよろしくお願いいたします